run PmtudProbe-0-20261014-15:45:59-2405
attr configname PmtudProbe
attr datetime 20261014-15:45:59
attr datetimef 20261014-154559
attr experiment PmtudProbe
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars ""
attr iterationvarsd ""
attr iterationvarsf ""
attr measurement ""
attr network PmtudNet
attr processid 2405
attr repetition 0
attr replication #0
attr resultdir results
